            "sid": "1SA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samwele alondolwele abantu insambu elyo ne milimo yaba pa bufumu. Epakulemba fyonse mu citabo no kubika pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Elyo Samwele asalanganya abantu, cila muntu ukuya kumwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo nao aile kumwakwe ku Gibea, na bantu ababulamba abo Lesa anashishe ku mitima bamushindika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
