            "sid": "1SA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo bamo bantalamisoka batile, “Bushe kuti uyu atupususha shani?” Balimusushishe nganshi kabili tabamupeeleko nangu fyabupe. Lelo Saulo atalelefye tondolo.",
          "type": "text",
